# ── Client environment (Vite) ──────────────────────────
# Only VITE_-prefixed vars are exposed to the browser. Never put secrets here.
#
# Copy to one of: .env.development (dev), .env.production (prod build), or .env.
#
# API base URL:
#   Dev  → leave empty; requests use the Vite proxy at /api (see vite.config.ts).
#   Prod → set to the API origin if served from a different domain,
#          e.g. https://api.parallaxflow.app/api
#          (or leave empty / "/api" when client and API share an origin).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
